# Imports & Types

## Path alias

Always use `@/` (maps to `./src/`). Never use relative `../../../` paths.

## Import order

1. External packages (`react`, `next`, `mongoose`, `zod`, `lucide-react`)
2. Internal libraries (`@/lib/...`)
3. Components (`@/components/...`, `@/features/...`)
4. Types (`@/types`, type-only imports)
5. Relative imports (`./SomeClient`)

## Types

- Domain interfaces in `src/types/index.ts` with `I` prefix: `IBeat`, `IUser`.
- Zod-inferred types in validators: `CreateBeatInput`.
- UI types in feature files: `BeatPackUi`.
- Use `import type` for type-only imports.
- No `any` — use `unknown` and narrow with type guards.
